K to:\n1. Ensure their account has minimum XLM balance (at least 1 XLM recommended)\n2. Create a trustline to the PYUSD issuer for the PYUSD asset\n3. Confirm the trustline is active before requesting withdrawal\n\n**Verifying Trustline Status:**\n\nYou can verify if an address has the required trustline by:\n- Using Stellar blockchain explorers (e.g., stellar.expert)\n- Querying the Stellar Horizon API\n- Using the Stellar SDK to check account balances\n","href":"/api-reference/endpoints/crypto-withdrawals/create-crypto-withdrawal"},"description":{"compiledSource":"\"use strict\";\nconst {Fragment: _Fragment, jsx: _jsx, jsxs: _jsxs} = arguments[0];\nconst {useMDXComponents: _provideComponents} = arguments[0];\nfunction _createMdxContent(props) {\n  const _components = {\n    a: \"a\",\n    code: \"code\",\n    li: \"li\",\n    ol: \"ol\",\n    p: \"p\",\n    strong: \"strong\",\n    ul: \"ul\",\n    ..._provideComponents(),\n    ...props.components\n  };\n  return _jsxs(_Fragment, {\n    children: [_jsx(_components.p, {\n      children: \"Withdraw a cryptocurrency asset to a specified destination address.\"\n    }), \"\\n\", _jsx(_components.p, {\n      children: \"A request to create a crypto withdrawal can fail with one of the following\\ntypes of errors:\"\n    }), \"\\n\", _jsxs(_components.ul, {\n      children: [\"\\n\", _jsxs(_components.li, {\n        children: [_jsx(_components.a, {\n          href: \"https://developer.paxos.com/docs/v2/problems/travel-rule-information-required\",\n          children: \"Travel Rule Information Required\"\n        }), \"\\nif the withdrawal requires Travel Rule information and the destination address is missing it.\"]\n      }), \"\\n\"]\n    }), \"\\n\", _jsx(_components.p, {\n      children: _jsx(_components.strong, {\n        children: \"Important for Stellar Network (PYUSD):\"\n      })\n    }), \"\\n\", _jsx(_components.p, {\n      children: \"When withdrawing PYUSD on the Stellar network, the destination address must 