m\":\"https://docs.paxos.com/api-reference/endpoints/transfers/overview\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Create Crypto Withdrawal\",\"item\":\"https://docs.paxos.com/api-reference/endpoints/crypto-withdrawals/create-crypto-withdrawal\"}]},{\"@type\":[\"TechArticle\",\"APIReference\"],\"@id\":\"https://docs.paxos.com/api-reference/endpoints/crypto-withdrawals/create-crypto-withdrawal#apireference\",\"headline\":\"Create Crypto Withdrawal\",\"name\":\"Create Crypto Withdrawal\",\"description\":\"Withdraw a cryptocurrency asset to a specified destination address. A request to create a crypto withdrawal can fail with one of the following types of errors: - Travel Rule Information Required if the withdrawal requires Travel Rule information and the destination address is missing it. Important for Stellar Network (PYUSD): When withdrawing PYUSD on the Stellar network, the destination address must have an established trustline with the PYUSD issuer: - PYUSD Issuer: GDQE7IXJ4HUHV6RQHIUPRJSEZE4DRS5WY577O2FY6YQ5LVWZ7JZTU2V5 (mainnet) - Asset Code: PYUSD How to Establish a Trustline: The recipient must use a Stellar wallet or the Stellar SDK to: 1. Ensure their account has minimum XLM balance (at least 1 XLM recommended) 2. Create a trustline to the PYUSD issuer for the PYUSD asset 3. Confirm the trustline is active before requesting withdrawal Verifying Trustline Status: You can verify if an address has the required trustline by: - Using Stellar blockchain explorers (e.g., stellar.expert) - Querying the Stellar Horizon API - Using the Stellar SDK to check account balances\",\"url\":\"https://docs.paxos.com/api-reference/endpoints/crypto-withdrawals/create-crypto-withdrawal\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https://docs.paxos.com/api-reference/endpoints/crypto-withdrawals/create-crypto-withdrawal#webpage\"},\"dateModified\":\"2026-10-29T00:08:01.343Z\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://docs.paxos.com/#organization\"},\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://docs.paxos.com#website\"}}]}\u003c/script>","agentPointerHref":"/api-reference/endpoints/crypto-withdrawals/create-crypto-withdrawal.md","siteName":"Paxos Documentation","nav":{"global":{"anchors":[{"anchor":"Changelog","icon":"https://mintlify.s3.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/paxos-0ac97319/images/icons/book-open.svg","href":"https://docs.paxos.com/changelog"},{"anchor":"Status","icon":"https://mintlify.s3.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/paxos-0ac97319/images/icons/signal.svg","href":"https://status.paxos.com/"},{"anchor":"Blog","icon":"https://mintlify.s3.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/paxos-0ac97319/images/icons/newspaper.svg","href":"https://www.paxos.com/blog"},{"anchor":"Faucet","icon":"https://mintlify.s3.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/paxos-0ac97319/images/icons/droplets.svg","href":"https://faucet.paxos.com/"},{"anchor":"Regulation and Transparency","icon":"https://mintlify.s3.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/paxos-0ac97319/images/icons/landmark.svg","href":"https://www.paxos.com/regulation-and-transparency/"}]},"tabs":[{"tab":"Welcome","pages":[{"title":"Welcome","href":"/welcome"}]},{"tab":"Developer Guide","pages":[{"title":"Developer Guide","href":"/guides/developer/account"}]},{"tab":"Dashboard Guide","pages":[{"title":"Dashboard Guide","href":"/guides/dashboard"}]},{"tab":"Stablecoins","pages":[{"title":"Stablecoins","href":"/guides/stablecoin"}]},{"tab":"API Reference","groups":[{"group":"API Documentation","pages":[{"title":"Paxos API","href":"/api-reference/introduction"}]},{"group":"Deposits and Withdrawals","pages":[{"group":"Transfers","pages":[{"title":"Overview","href":"/api-reference/endpoints/transfers/overview"},{"openapi":"get /transfer/transfers","title":"List Transfers","href":"/api-reference/endpoints/transfers/list-transfers"},{"openapi":"get /transfer/transfers/{id}","title":"Get Transfer","href":"/api-reference/endpoints/transfers/get-transfer"}]},{"group":"Fiat Transfers","pages":[{"title":"Overview","href":"/api-reference/endpoints/fiat-transfers/overview"},{"openapi":"get /transfer/fiat-accounts","title":"List Fiat Accounts","href":"/api-reference/endpoints/fiat-transfers/list-fiat-accounts"},{"openapi":"post /transfer/fiat-accounts","title":"Create Fiat Account","href":"/api-reference/endpoints/fiat-transfers/create-fiat-account"},{"openapi":"get /transfer/fiat-accounts/{id}","title":"Get Fiat Account","href":"/api-reference/endpoints/fiat-transfers/get-fiat-account"},{"openapi":"put /transfer/fiat-accounts/{id}","title":"Update Fiat Account","href":"/api-reference/endpoints/fiat-transfers/update-fiat-account"},{"openapi":"delete /transfer/fiat-accounts/{id}","title":"Delete Fiat Account","href":"/api-reference/endpoints/fiat-transfers/delete-fiat-account"},{"openapi":"get /transfer/fiat-deposit-instructions","title":"List Fiat Deposit Instructions","href":"/api-reference/endpoints/fiat-transfers/list-fiat-deposit-instructions"},{"openapi":"post /transfer/fiat-deposit-instructions","title":"Create Fiat Deposit Instructions","href":"/api-reference/endpoints/fiat-transfers/create-fiat-deposit-instructions"},{"openapi":"get /transfer/fiat-deposit-instructions/{id}","title":"Get Fiat Deposit Instructions","href":"/api-reference/endpoints/fiat-transfers/get-fiat-deposit-instructions"},{"openapi":"post /transfer/fiat-withdrawals","title":"Create Fiat Withdrawal","href":"/api-reference/endpoints/fiat-transfers/create-fiat-withdrawal"}]},{"group":"Deposit Addresses","pages":[{"openapi":"get /transfer/deposit-addresses","title":"List Deposit Addresses","href":"/api-reference/endpoints/deposit-addresses/list-deposit-addresses"},{"openapi":"post /transfer/deposit-addresses","title":"Create Deposit Address","href":"/api-reference/endpoints/deposit-addresses/create-deposit-address"}]},{"group":"Crypto Deposits","pages":[{"title":"Overview","href":"/api-reference/endpoints/crypto-deposits/overview"},{"openapi":"post /transfer/crypto-deposits/{id}/update","title":"Update Crypto Deposit","href":"/api-reference/endpoints/crypto-deposits/update-crypto-deposit"},{"openapi":"post /transfer/crypto-deposits/{id}/reject","title":"Reject Crypto Deposit","description":"Reject a crypto deposit which is waiting for required travel rule information about the originator address.\nIf the rejected deposit has any status other than `NEEDS_INFO`, the request will return an error.\nOnly the creator of the crypto deposit can reject it.","href":"/api-reference/endpoints/crypto-deposits/reject-crypto-deposit"}]},{"group":"Crypto Withdrawals","pages":[{"openapi":"post /transfer/crypto-withdrawals","title":"Create Crypto Withdrawal","href":"/api-reference/endpoints/crypto-withdrawals/create-crypto-withdrawal"}]},{"group":"Crypto Destination Addresses","pages":[{"openapi":"get /transfer/crypto-destination-addresses","title":"List Crypto Destination Addresses","description":"List all crypto destination addresses, optionally filtering and paging the results","href":"/api-reference/endpoints/crypto-destination-addresses/list-crypto-destination-addresses"},{"openapi":"put /transfer/crypto-destination-address","title":"Put Crypto Destination Addresses","href":"/api-reference/endpoints/crypto-destination-addresses/put-crypto-destination-address"}]},{"group":"VASPs for Travel Rule","pages":[{"title":"List VASPs","openapi":"get /travelrule/vasps","href":"/api-reference/endpoints/vasps/list-vasps"},{"title":"Get VASP","openapi":"get /travelrule/vasps/{id}","href":"/api-reference/endpoints/vasps/get-vasp"}]},{"group":"Fees","pages":[{"openapi":"post /transfer/fees/crypto-withdrawal","title":"Create Crypto Withdrawal Fee","href":"/api-reference/endpoints/fees/create-crypto-withdrawal-fee"}]},{"group":"Internal Transfers","pages":[{"openapi":"post /transfer/internal","title":"Create Internal Transfer","href":"/api-reference/endpoints/internal-transfers/create-internal-transfer"}]},{"group":"Paxos Transfers","pages":[{"title":"Overview","href":"/api-reference/endpoints/paxos-transfers/overview"},{"openapi":"post /transfer/paxos","title":"Create Paxo